# Nothing is required. The vault generates its own keys and is configured in the browser (/setup).
# Production Deploy to Cloudflare provisions OWNER_GITHUB_ID automatically.
# For local development only, uncomment and set your numeric GitHub user ID:
# OWNER_GITHUB_ID=12345678
# Optional: VAULT_MASTER_KEY=<openssl rand -base64 32> keeps the master key out of the database.
